---
import BrainData from "./BrainData.astro";
---

<div class="flex items-center justify-around py-24 md:mx-8 md:gap-12 h-fit">
  <div
    class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:pl-12 lg:pr-16 xl:px-8 justify-center xl:w-[32%] lg:w-[40%] md:w-[40%] xl:pr-[93px]"
  >
    <h1 class="font-roboto font-medium text-black leading-4 tracking-widest">
      HOW IT WORKS
    </h1>
    <h2
      class="text-[#4F7363FF] text-[26px] font-inter tracking-wider font-semibold pr-2"
    >
      Moka integrates ancestral knowledge with cutting edge technology
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-[#BBBBBBFF] xl:text-[24px] font-inter font-medium lg:text-[18px] leading-12 lg:pr-16"
    >
      Moka leverages empirical data and in-silico analysis to progress from the
      source to the molecule and its biological activity.
    </p>
  </div>
  <BrainData />
</div>
